            "heading": "Part D: Saboot 2: Particles ke beech mein khaali jagah (space) hoti hai",
            "headingHinglish": "Part D: Saboot 2: Particles ke beech mein khaali jagah (space) hoti hai",
            "body": "Agar matter ke kan ek doosre se bilkul chipke hote, to kuch bhi **doosri cheez usme mil nahi sakti** thi. Par hum dekhte hain ki cheezein aapas mein mil jaati hain. Iska matlab kanon ke beech **khaali jagah** hoti hai. Ek-ek saboot dekhte hain.\n\n### Saboot 2a: Cheeni ya namak ghulne par paani ka level\n\nEk glass mein pehle se 100 mL paani lo aur level par nishaan lagao. Ab usme ek chammach **cheeni** daalo aur hilao, jab tak sab ghul na jaaye. Dekho ki paani ka **level lagbhag waisa hi** raha, ya bahut halka sa badha. Jabki cheeni ka chammach (jo apni jagah gherta tha) paani mein poori tarah gayab ho gaya.\n\n**Kyun?** Kyunki paani ke kanon ke **beech mein khaali jagah** thi. Cheeni ke kan wahin **ghus gaye**, jaise ek bhare hue bartan (jisme bahut kam jagah dikhti hai) mein aur chhoti cheezein ghus jaati hain.\n\n**Ek aam analogy:** Ek dibbe mein **marbles** bhar do. Dibba bhar gaya lagta hai. Ab usme **rait (sand)** daalo to rait marbles ke beech ki **khaali jagah** mein chali jaati hai aur dibba utna hi bhara dikhta hai. Isi tarah, paani ke kanon ke beech ki jagah mein cheeni ke kan chale jaate hain.\n\n### Saboot 2b: Syringe mein hawa dabana\n\nEk khaali **plastic syringe** lo (bina sui ke; dawai ki dukaan par aasani se milti hai). Piston ko aadha bahar kheencho taaki andar hawa bhar jaaye. Ab nozzle (aage ka chhota chhed) par **ungli rakhkar band** kar do aur piston ko dabao.\n\nTum dekhoge ki piston **kaafi neeche tak jaata hai**: hawa **dab gayi**. Matlab hawa ke kanon ke beech **bahut jagah thi**, jo dabaane par kam ho gayi.\n\nAb wahi syringe **paani se bharo** (nozzle band karke) aur piston dabao. Is baar piston **bahut kam** hilta hai, aur dabana mushkil lagta hai. Matlab hawa ki tulna mein paani ke kanon ke beech **kam jagah** hai.\n\n> Is topic mein hum sirf itna dekh rahe hain ki hawa mein jagah zyada hai aur paani mein kam. \"Kyun\" aur teeno roop (solid, liquid, gas) ki poori tulna agla topic hai.\n\n### Saboot 2c: Do liquids ka mix hona (sirf jaanne ke liye)\n\nLab mein ye dekha gaya hai ki agar **50 mL paani** aur **50 mL alcohol** milate hain to total volume **100 mL se thoda kam** (lagbhag 97 mL) aata hai. (Ye activity sirf teacher ki dekhrekh mein lab mein hoti hai.) Isse bhi yahi pata chalta hai ki ek liquid ke kanon ke beech jagah hoti hai jisme doosre liquid ke kan **ghus jaate hain**.\n\n```\n  Pehle                          Mix karne ke baad\n\n  Paani ke kan      Alcohol           Dono mix\n   o  o  o           x   x           o x  o  x o\n   o  o  o           x   x           x o  x  o x\n   o  o  o           x   x           o x  o  x o\n\n   (beech mein      (beech mein      (ek ke kan doosre ke kanon\n    jagah)           jagah)           ke beech ki jagah mein ghus gaye,\n                                      total volume thoda kam)\n```\n\n> **Figure 1.2** – Paani aur alcohol mix karne par ek ke kan doosre ke kanon ke beech ki khaali jagah mein ghus jaate hain, isliye total volume thoda kam aata hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Agar matter ke kan ek doosre se bilkul chipke hote, to kuch bhi **doosri cheez usme mil nahi sakti** thi. Par hum dekhte hain ki cheezein aapas mein mil jaati hain. Iska matlab kanon ke beech **khaali jagah** hoti hai. Ek-ek saboot dekhte hain.\n\n### Saboot 2a: Cheeni ya namak ghulne par paani ka level\n\nEk glass mein pehle se 100 mL paani lo aur level par nishaan lagao. Ab usme ek chammach **cheeni** daalo aur hilao, jab tak sab ghul na jaaye. Dekho ki paani ka **level lagbhag waisa hi** raha, ya bahut halka sa badha. Jabki cheeni ka chammach (jo apni jagah gherta tha) paani mein poori tarah gayab ho gaya.\n\n**Kyun?** Kyunki paani ke kanon ke **beech mein khaali jagah** thi. Cheeni ke kan wahin **ghus gaye**, jaise ek bhare hue bartan (jisme bahut kam jagah dikhti hai) mein aur chhoti cheezein ghus jaati hain.\n\n**Ek aam analogy:** Ek dibbe mein **marbles** bhar do. Dibba bhar gaya lagta hai. Ab usme **rait (sand)** daalo to rait marbles ke beech ki **khaali jagah** mein chali jaati hai aur dibba utna hi bhara dikhta hai. Isi tarah, paani ke kanon ke beech ki jagah mein cheeni ke kan chale jaate hain.\n\n### Saboot 2b: Syringe mein hawa dabana\n\nEk khaali **plastic syringe** lo (bina sui ke; dawai ki dukaan par aasani se milti hai). Piston ko aadha bahar kheencho taaki andar hawa bhar jaaye. Ab nozzle (aage ka chhota chhed) par **ungli rakhkar band** kar do aur piston ko dabao.\n\nTum dekhoge ki piston **kaafi neeche tak jaata hai**: hawa **dab gayi**. Matlab hawa ke kanon ke beech **bahut jagah thi**, jo dabaane par kam ho gayi.\n\nAb wahi syringe **paani se bharo** (nozzle band karke) aur piston dabao. Is baar piston **bahut kam** hilta hai, aur dabana mushkil lagta hai. Matlab hawa ki tulna mein paani ke kanon ke beech **kam jagah** hai.\n\n> Is topic mein hum sirf itna dekh rahe hain ki hawa mein jagah zyada hai aur paani mein kam. \"Kyun\" aur teeno roop (solid, liquid, gas) ki poori tulna agla topic hai.\n\n### Saboot 2c: Do liquids ka mix hona (sirf jaanne ke liye)\n\nLab mein ye dekha gaya hai ki agar **50 mL paani** aur **50 mL alcohol** milate hain to total volume **100 mL se thoda kam** (lagbhag 97 mL) aata hai. (Ye activity sirf teacher ki dekhrekh mein lab mein hoti hai.) Isse bhi yahi pata chalta hai ki ek liquid ke kanon ke beech jagah hoti hai jisme doosre liquid ke kan **ghus jaate hain**.\n\n```\n  Pehle                          Mix karne ke baad\n\n  Paani ke kan      Alcohol           Dono mix\n   o  o  o           x   x           o x  o  x o\n   o  o  o           x   x           x o  x  o x\n   o  o  o           x   x           o x  o  x o\n\n   (beech mein      (beech mein      (ek ke kan doosre ke kanon\n    jagah)           jagah)           ke beech ki jagah mein ghus gaye,\n                                      total volume thoda kam)\n```\n\n> **Figure 1.2** – Paani aur alcohol mix karne par ek ke kan doosre ke kanon ke beech ki khaali jagah mein ghus jaate hain, isliye total volume thoda kam aata hai."
