            "headingHinglish": "Sadak par neon sign aur aasmaan mein bijli",
            "body": "Shaam ko Mr. Mendonca apni beti Avni ke saath sair par nikle the. Ek dukaan ke bahar laal-narangi rang ka **neon sign** jagmaga raha tha: \"OPEN\". Dukaan ke andar tubelight bhi chamak rahi thi. Tabhi door aasmaan mein bijli ki ek tez lakeer kaundhi aur gayab ho gayi.\n\nAvni ne sign ki taraf dekha, phir aasmaan ki taraf. \"Papa, ye sign ke andar jo chamak rahi hai, wo kya hai? Dikhta to kuch bhi nahi, bas roshni hai. Maine padha tha ki gas dikhti nahi. To ye chamakti gas hai kya? Aur bijli ki lakeer aur tare... kya ye sab ek hi cheez hain?\"\n\nMr. Mendonca hanse, \"Zabardast sawal! Sign ke andar gas hi hai, par bijli guzarne se uske kuch kan charged ho jaate hain aur gas chamakne lagti hai. Aur haan, bijli ki lakeer aur tare us se judey hain. Chalo, matter ki do aur states se milte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Shaam ko Mr. Mendonca apni beti Avni ke saath sair par nikle the. Ek dukaan ke bahar laal-narangi rang ka **neon sign** jagmaga raha tha: \"OPEN\". Dukaan ke andar tubelight bhi chamak rahi thi. Tabhi door aasmaan mein bijli ki ek tez lakeer kaundhi aur gayab ho gayi.\n\nAvni ne sign ki taraf dekha, phir aasmaan ki taraf. \"Papa, ye sign ke andar jo chamak rahi hai, wo kya hai? Dikhta to kuch bhi nahi, bas roshni hai. Maine padha tha ki gas dikhti nahi. To ye chamakti gas hai kya? Aur bijli ki lakeer aur tare... kya ye sab ek hi cheez hain?\"\n\nMr. Mendonca hanse, \"Zabardast sawal! Sign ke andar gas hi hai, par bijli guzarne se uske kuch kan charged ho jaate hain aur gas chamakne lagti hai. Aur haan, bijli ki lakeer aur tare us se judey hain. Chalo, matter ki do aur states se milte hain.\""
