            "body": "Avni aur Mr. Mendonca ghar ki taraf mude. Avni ne kaha, \"Papa, ab mujhe samajh aaya: sign ki chamak, tare, bijli, ye sab plasma hai. Aur hawa, paani, barf ke saath ye do states milakar matter ki poori family ban jaati hai.\" Mr. Mendonca ne muskura kar sir hilaya: \"Aur dekho, ye sab ek hi cheez se bana hai: chhote-chhote particles. Bas unki garmi aur arrangement badalta hai.\"\n\nPoore chapter ka hisaab ek nazar mein:\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Matter kya hai aur particle nature | Matter chhote-chhote particles ka bana hai: wo bahut chhote hain, unke beech jagah hai, wo hamesha harkat karte hain (diffusion) aur ek doosre ko kheenchte hain. |\n| Topic 2 | Solid, liquid, gas ke gun | Particles ki baithak, harkat aur aakarshan se shape, volume, dabna, behna, density aur diffusion ki raftaar tay hoti hai. |\n| Topic 3 | State badalna: temperature aur pressure | Garmi dene ya nikalne se state badalti hai (melting, boiling, sublimation, deposition); har padaarth ke apne melting aur boiling point; K = °C + 273; dabane aur thanda karne se gas liquid banti hai (LPG). |\n| Topic 4 | Evaporation | Evaporation har temperature par surface se hota hai, factors se tez ya dheema hota hai, aur thandak deta hai. |\n| Topic 5 | Plasma aur BEC | Plasma bahut garam ionised gas hai; BEC absolute zero ke paas ki state; matter ki paanch states hain. |\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab tak humne matter ko ek hi cheez maan kar dekha. Par asli duniya mein cheezein mili-juli hoti hain: namak-paani, dhuaan, mitti. Agle chapter **\"Is Matter Around Us Pure?\"** mein hum seekhenge ki mixtures aur solutions kya hote hain aur unhe alag kaise kiya jaata hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Avni aur Mr. Mendonca ghar ki taraf mude. Avni ne kaha, \"Papa, ab mujhe samajh aaya: sign ki chamak, tare, bijli, ye sab plasma hai. Aur hawa, paani, barf ke saath ye do states milakar matter ki poori family ban jaati hai.\" Mr. Mendonca ne muskura kar sir hilaya: \"Aur dekho, ye sab ek hi cheez se bana hai: chhote-chhote particles. Bas unki garmi aur arrangement badalta hai.\"\n\nPoore chapter ka hisaab ek nazar mein:\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Matter kya hai aur particle nature | Matter chhote-chhote particles ka bana hai: wo bahut chhote hain, unke beech jagah hai, wo hamesha harkat karte hain (diffusion) aur ek doosre ko kheenchte hain. |\n| Topic 2 | Solid, liquid, gas ke gun | Particles ki baithak, harkat aur aakarshan se shape, volume, dabna, behna, density aur diffusion ki raftaar tay hoti hai. |\n| Topic 3 | State badalna: temperature aur pressure | Garmi dene ya nikalne se state badalti hai (melting, boiling, sublimation, deposition); har padaarth ke apne melting aur boiling point; K = °C + 273; dabane aur thanda karne se gas liquid banti hai (LPG). |\n| Topic 4 | Evaporation | Evaporation har temperature par surface se hota hai, factors se tez ya dheema hota hai, aur thandak deta hai. |\n| Topic 5 | Plasma aur BEC | Plasma bahut garam ionised gas hai; BEC absolute zero ke paas ki state; matter ki paanch states hain. |\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab tak humne matter ko ek hi cheez maan kar dekha. Par asli duniya mein cheezein mili-juli hoti hain: namak-paani, dhuaan, mitti. Agle chapter **\"Is Matter Around Us Pure?\"** mein hum seekhenge ki mixtures aur solutions kya hote hain aur unhe alag kaise kiya jaata hai."
