            "headingHinglish": "Kohre mein chamakti headlight",
            "body": "Ms. Menezes apne parivaar ke saath subah-subah highway par trip par nikli thi. Peeche ki seat par unka bhanja Atharv baitha tha, jo school mein Class 9 mein tha. Bahar **ghana kohra (fog)** tha. Papa ne gaadi ki headlight on ki, aur Atharv ne ek ajeeb cheez dekhi: headlight ki roshni hawa mein ek **moti, saaf, chamakti hui lakeer** ki tarah dikh rahi thi, jaise koi thos chhad ho. Jabki raat ko saaf mausam mein beam itni nahi dikhti.\n\n\"Mausi, ye roshni hawa mein itni saaf kyun dikh rahi hai? Hawa to transparent hoti hai!\" Atharv ne poochha.\n\nMs. Menezes muskuraayi, \"Kyunki aaj hawa akeli nahi hai Atharv. Hawa mein **paani ki bahut-bahut chhoti boondein** tair rahi hain. Ye boondein itni chhoti hain ki gir nahi rahi, par itni badi hain ki roshni ko idhar-udhar bikher deti hain. Isi se beam ka raasta hamari aankhon ko dikhta hai.\" Phir usne hansi mein kaha, \"Ghar pahunch kar tum ye khud karke dekhna. Bas ek torch, ek glass paani aur thoda doodh chahiye.\"\n\nAtharv ko lagne laga ki kohra, doodh aur mitti wala paani, teeno ek hi parivaar ke alag-alag sadasya hain. Aaj hum isi parivaar se milenge.",
