            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Pichhle topics mein humne dekha ki hamare aas-paas ki zyaadatar cheezein **mixture** hain: solution, suspension aur colloid. Topic 3 ke aakhir mein ek baat nikli thi: suspension ke particles bade hote hain, isliye wo **neeche baith jaate hain** aur **filter paper mein ruk jaate hain**, jabki solution ke particles filter paper se nikal jaate hain. Yaani mixture ke hisson mein koi na koi **fark** hota hai. Ab sawal ye hai: agar hume mixture ke hisse **alag-alag** chahiye hon, to us fark ka faayda kaise uthayein? Aaj ke topic mein hum sabse aasaan tareeke seekhenge.",
