            "heading": "Part E: Ek mixed sample ka poora plan (Method chooser)",
            "headingHinglish": "Part E: Ek mixed sample ka poora plan (Method chooser)",
            "body": "Ab sab seekhe hue tareeke ek saath. Ms. Awasthi ne Saanvi ko ek challenge diya: **\"Ek bartan mein ret (sand), namak, lohe ka burada (iron filings) aur paani mile hue hain. In chaaron ko alag-alag kaise nikaaloge? Step order batao.\"**\n\nSaanvi ne pehle **sochne ka tareeka** apnaya: har cheez ki **alag property** dhoondho.\n\n| Cheez | Alag property |\n|---|---|\n| Lohe ka burada (iron filings) | Magnet se chipakta hai, baaki kuch nahi chipakta |\n| Ret (sand) | Paani mein nahi ghulti, mote kan, filter paper par ruk jaati hai |\n| Namak | Paani mein ghul jaata hai, filter paper se nikal jaata hai |\n| Paani | Ubalta hai (100 °C), bhaap ban sakta hai, namak nahi udta |\n\n**Step order (kyun is order mein):**\n\n1. **Magnet se lohe ka burada nikalo.** Ye sabse pehle kyun? Kyunki iske liye mixture ke **geela hone ki zarurat nahi**, aur agar baad mein chhodein to filtration ya doosre steps ke beech mein ye bura-bura phaila ya kharab ho sakta hai. (Agar mixture geela hai, to magnet ko **plastic ki thaili mein rakhkar** ghumao, taaki burada saaf nikalke thaili se hat sake.) Ek baar iska kaam ho gaya, ab baaki teen cheezein bachi.\n2. **Filtration (chhaanna) se ret alag karo.** Mixture ko filter paper se chhano. **Ret** filter paper par reh jaati hai (**residue**), aur **namak-paani wala ghol** neeche aa jaata hai (**filtrate**). (Topic 4 ka filtration.) Ret ko paani se dho kar sukha lo.\n3. **Ab namak-paani ka ghol bacha.** Do option hain, apni zarurat ke hisaab se:\n   - **Agar namak chahiye (paani ki parwah nahi):** **evaporation** ya, behtar, **crystallisation**. Ghol ko dheere garam karo (adult/teacher), thoda gaadha karke dheere thanda ya sukhne do, namak ke crystal bante hain.\n   - **Agar paani bhi chahiye:** **simple distillation**. Paani bhaap bankar condenser mein saaf paani ban jaata hai, aur namak flask mein reh jaata hai.\n\n**Final summary:**\n\n| Step | Tareeka | Kya nikalta hai |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Magnet | Lohe ka burada |\n| 2 | Filtration | Ret (residue) |\n| 3a | Crystallisation ya evaporation | Namak |\n| 3b | Distillation | Saaf paani (aur residue mein namak) |\n\n**Kya order badal sakte hain?** Agar pehle filtration karte, to filter paper par **ret aur lohe ka burada dono** aa jaate, aur unko alag karne ke liye baad mein magnet lagana padta. Wo bhi chalta, par pehle magnet lagane se kaam **seedha aur saaf** rehta hai. Yaad rakho: **order wo chuno jisme har step mixture ko saral banaye**.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ab sab seekhe hue tareeke ek saath. Ms. Awasthi ne Saanvi ko ek challenge diya: **\"Ek bartan mein ret (sand), namak, lohe ka burada (iron filings) aur paani mile hue hain. In chaaron ko alag-alag kaise nikaaloge? Step order batao.\"**\n\nSaanvi ne pehle **sochne ka tareeka** apnaya: har cheez ki **alag property** dhoondho.\n\n| Cheez | Alag property |\n|---|---|\n| Lohe ka burada (iron filings) | Magnet se chipakta hai, baaki kuch nahi chipakta |\n| Ret (sand) | Paani mein nahi ghulti, mote kan, filter paper par ruk jaati hai |\n| Namak | Paani mein ghul jaata hai, filter paper se nikal jaata hai |\n| Paani | Ubalta hai (100 °C), bhaap ban sakta hai, namak nahi udta |\n\n**Step order (kyun is order mein):**\n\n1. **Magnet se lohe ka burada nikalo.** Ye sabse pehle kyun? Kyunki iske liye mixture ke **geela hone ki zarurat nahi**, aur agar baad mein chhodein to filtration ya doosre steps ke beech mein ye bura-bura phaila ya kharab ho sakta hai. (Agar mixture geela hai, to magnet ko **plastic ki thaili mein rakhkar** ghumao, taaki burada saaf nikalke thaili se hat sake.) Ek baar iska kaam ho gaya, ab baaki teen cheezein bachi.\n2. **Filtration (chhaanna) se ret alag karo.** Mixture ko filter paper se chhano. **Ret** filter paper par reh jaati hai (**residue**), aur **namak-paani wala ghol** neeche aa jaata hai (**filtrate**). (Topic 4 ka filtration.) Ret ko paani se dho kar sukha lo.\n3. **Ab namak-paani ka ghol bacha.** Do option hain, apni zarurat ke hisaab se:\n   - **Agar namak chahiye (paani ki parwah nahi):** **evaporation** ya, behtar, **crystallisation**. Ghol ko dheere garam karo (adult/teacher), thoda gaadha karke dheere thanda ya sukhne do, namak ke crystal bante hain.\n   - **Agar paani bhi chahiye:** **simple distillation**. Paani bhaap bankar condenser mein saaf paani ban jaata hai, aur namak flask mein reh jaata hai.\n\n**Final summary:**\n\n| Step | Tareeka | Kya nikalta hai |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Magnet | Lohe ka burada |\n| 2 | Filtration | Ret (residue) |\n| 3a | Crystallisation ya evaporation | Namak |\n| 3b | Distillation | Saaf paani (aur residue mein namak) |\n\n**Kya order badal sakte hain?** Agar pehle filtration karte, to filter paper par **ret aur lohe ka burada dono** aa jaate, aur unko alag karne ke liye baad mein magnet lagana padta. Wo bhi chalta, par pehle magnet lagane se kaam **seedha aur saaf** rehta hai. Yaad rakho: **order wo chuno jisme har step mixture ko saral banaye**."
