            "headingHinglish": "Gadget Gali ki dukaan",
            "body": "Shanivaar ko Ms. Ojha apne bhatije Naksh ko apni mobile accessories ki dukaan \"Gadget Gali\" mein le gayi. Counter par chargers, cables aur adapters ke dibbe the. Naksh ne ek 3-pin wala charger uthaya aur ek 2-hole wale socket mein lagane ki koshish ki. Nahi laga.\n\n\"Aunty, ye to fit hi nahi ho raha!\" usne kaha.\n\nMs. Ojha hansi. \"Har plug ke paas **kuch pins** hote hain aur har socket ke paas **kuch holes**. Jodi tabhi poori hoti hai jab **pins aur holes barabar** ho jaayein. 3-pin wale plug ko 3-hole wala socket chahiye. Agar tumhare paas 3-pin wale plug hain aur sirf 2-hole wale socket, to kya karoge?\"\n\nNaksh ne socha. \"Plug aur socket **ginti mein badha lunga**. 2 plug se 6 pins, aur 3 socket se 6 holes. Ab 6 aur 6 barabar!\"\n\n\"Bilkul. Yehi chemistry ka formula banane ka raaz hai,\" Ms. Ojha ne kaha. \"Positive radical **plug** hai, jiske charge ke number jitne pins hain. Negative radical **socket** hai, jiske charge ke number jitne holes hain. Formula wahi, jisme total pins aur total holes barabar hon. Aaj ye 'matching' hum seekhenge.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Shanivaar ko Ms. Ojha apne bhatije Naksh ko apni mobile accessories ki dukaan \"Gadget Gali\" mein le gayi. Counter par chargers, cables aur adapters ke dibbe the. Naksh ne ek 3-pin wala charger uthaya aur ek 2-hole wale socket mein lagane ki koshish ki. Nahi laga.\n\n\"Aunty, ye to fit hi nahi ho raha!\" usne kaha.\n\nMs. Ojha hansi. \"Har plug ke paas **kuch pins** hote hain aur har socket ke paas **kuch holes**. Jodi tabhi poori hoti hai jab **pins aur holes barabar** ho jaayein. 3-pin wale plug ko 3-hole wala socket chahiye. Agar tumhare paas 3-pin wale plug hain aur sirf 2-hole wale socket, to kya karoge?\"\n\nNaksh ne socha. \"Plug aur socket **ginti mein badha lunga**. 2 plug se 6 pins, aur 3 socket se 6 holes. Ab 6 aur 6 barabar!\"\n\n\"Bilkul. Yehi chemistry ka formula banane ka raaz hai,\" Ms. Ojha ne kaha. \"Positive radical **plug** hai, jiske charge ke number jitne pins hain. Negative radical **socket** hai, jiske charge ke number jitne holes hain. Formula wahi, jisme total pins aur total holes barabar hon. Aaj ye 'matching' hum seekhenge.\""
