            "explanation": "Chemical formula: Kisi compound ko symbols aur chhote numbers se likhne ka tareeka, jo batata hai ki kaun se tatva ya radical, kitni ginti mein hain (Example: NaCl, CaCO₃).",
            "explanationHinglish": "Chemical formula ka matlab hai: Kisi compound ko symbols aur chhote numbers se likhne ka tareeka, jo batata hai ki kaun se tatva ya radical, kitni ginti mein hain (Udaharan: NaCl, CaCO₃)."
