            "body": "Ms. Rajput ki bhatiji Aanya chhutti mein unke ghar aayi thi. Ms. Rajput ke paas ek antacid ki effervescent tablet thi, wahi jo paani mein daalte hi fizz karti hai. Aanya ne poochha, \"Bua, ye tablet gayab kaise ho jaati hai? Kya iska vazan bhi khatam ho jaata hai?\"\n\nMs. Rajput muskurayi. \"Chal, rasoi ke digital kata (kitchen scale) par dekhte hain. Bas ek baat: ye sab tum bade ki nigrani mein hi karogi, aur tablet ko kabhi khana nahi hai.\"\n\nUnhone ek plastic ki bottle li, usme thoda paani bhara, aur tablet ko cap ke andar ek tissue mein alag rakha taaki wo abhi paani mein na gire. Poori bottle (paani, tablet aur cap ke saath) kata par rakhi: **250.0 g**. Phir bottle ko palat kar tablet paani mein giraayi aur cap kas kar band rakha. Bottle mein fizz hui, bubbles uthe, bottle thodi tight ho gayi. Aanya ne kata par dekha: **250.0 g**, bilkul wahi.\n\n\"Ab kya hua?\" Aanya ne soch kar kaha, \"Gas to bani, par vazan wahi!\"\n\nAb Ms. Rajput ne wahi experiment **khuli bottle** (cap hataye, upar se khuli) mein dohraya. Tablet girne se pehle kata ne 250.0 g dikhaya. Fizz khatam hone par kata ne dikhaya **249.6 g**. Aanya chaunk gayi. \"Ab 0.4 g kam ho gaya! Kya vazan sach mein khatam ho gaya?\"\n\n\"Nahi,\" Ms. Rajput boli. \"Jo gas bani, wo bottle se bahar nikal gayi. Wo gas hawa mein chali gayi aur hum use kata par tol nahi paye. Cap lagate hi gas bottle mein rukti hai, aur vazan wahi rehta hai. Dhyan se dekho: **gayab kuch nahi hua**, bas hum gas ko tolna bhool gaye.\"\n\n(Ye numbers ek udaharan hain, sahi tablet aur bottle ke hisaab se thode alag aa sakte hain. Par pattern wahi rahega.)\n\nIsi sawaal ko ek insaan ne bahut pehle bahut dhyan se parkha tha. Aao uski kahani aur uska niyam dekhte hain.",
