            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Dravyaman (mass)** | Kisi cheez mein kitna padaarth hai, ye mapne wali raashi; kata se gram ya kilogram mein tolte hain | 12 g carbon |\n| **Reactant** | Reaction shuru karne wali cheez | Carbon aur oxygen |\n| **Product** | Reaction se bani nayi cheez | Carbon dioxide |\n| **Closed system** | Aisa set-up jisme se na kuch bahar ja sake na andar aa sake | Cap kasi hui bottle |\n| **Open system** | Aisa set-up jisme gas aur dhuaan bahar ya andar aa-ja sakte hain | Khuli bottle, jalta kagaz |\n| **Law of Conservation of Mass** | Chemical reaction mein kul mass na banta hai, na khatam hota hai | Reactants ka total = products ka total |\n| **Conservation** | Surakshit rehna, yaani matra ka wahi rehna | Pehle 250.0 g, baad mein bhi 250.0 g |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Dravyaman (mass)** | Kisi cheez mein kitna padaarth hai, ye mapne wali raashi; kata se gram ya kilogram mein tolte hain | 12 g carbon |\n| **Reactant** | Reaction shuru karne wali cheez | Carbon aur oxygen |\n| **Product** | Reaction se bani nayi cheez | Carbon dioxide |\n| **Closed system** | Aisa set-up jisme se na kuch bahar ja sake na andar aa sake | Cap kasi hui bottle |\n| **Open system** | Aisa set-up jisme gas aur dhuaan bahar ya andar aa-ja sakte hain | Khuli bottle, jalta kagaz |\n| **Law of Conservation of Mass** | Chemical reaction mein kul mass na banta hai, na khatam hota hai | Reactants ka total = products ka total |\n| **Conservation** | Surakshit rehna, yaani matra ka wahi rehna | Pehle 250.0 g, baad mein bhi 250.0 g |"
