            "body": "Pichhle topic mein Dalton ne bataya ki har tatva ke atoms ka apna ek **fixed dravyaman (mass)** hota hai, aur isi se Topic 2 ka \"fixed hisaab\" samajh aaya. Par ab ek seedha sawaal: ek atom ka dravyaman **kitna** hota hai? Aur itne chhote atom ko hum tolenge kaise? Is topic mein hum atoms aur molecules ke dravyaman ko ek chhoti si **tulna ki ginti** se likhna seekhenge, aur dekhenge ki formula dekh kar hi paani ka 1 : 8 wala hisaab kaise nikal aata hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein Dalton ne bataya ki har tatva ke atoms ka apna ek **fixed dravyaman (mass)** hota hai, aur isi se Topic 2 ka \"fixed hisaab\" samajh aaya. Par ab ek seedha sawaal: ek atom ka dravyaman **kitna** hota hai? Aur itne chhote atom ko hum tolenge kaise? Is topic mein hum atoms aur molecules ke dravyaman ko ek chhoti si **tulna ki ginti** se likhna seekhenge, aur dekhenge ki formula dekh kar hi paani ka 1 : 8 wala hisaab kaise nikal aata hai."
