            "body": "Pichhle chapter mein Dalton ne kaha tha ki atom sabse chhota kan hai jise todna mumkin nahi. Par humne wahi table mein ye bhi likha tha ki ye baat **adhoori** hai, aur ki iska jawab is chapter mein milega. Ab wo waqt aa gaya hai. Is topic mein hum dekhenge ki vaigyanikon ko kaise pata chala ki atom ke andar **teen** tarah ke chhote kan hote hain: **electron, proton aur neutron**. Aur ye bhi ki ek atom bahar se \"neutral\" kyun dikhta hai.",
