            "body": "Pichhle topic ke end mein ek pareshaan karne wala sawaal chhoda tha. Rutherford ke model mein electron nucleus ke aas-paas ghoomta hai. Lekin ghoomta hua electron dheere-dheere energy kho dega aur ghoomte-ghoomte nucleus mein gir jaayega, yaani atom kabhi stable hona hi nahi chahiye. Phir bhi hamare aas-paas ke atom saalon-saal bane rehte hain. Is topic mein hum dekhenge ki **Niels Bohr** ne is samasya ka kaunsa seedha-sa hal diya, aur uske baad electrons atom mein **kis niyam se baithte hain**.",
