            "headingHinglish": "Roll number aur class ka total",
            "body": "Ms. Ganguly ne subah class mein **roll call** liya. Unke register mein har bachche ka ek roll number tha, aur Ishwar ka roll number 11 tha. Ishwar ne register mein jhaank kar poocha, \"Madam, mera roll number 11 hai, aur class mein 40 bachche hain. Ye 11 aur 40 mein se mera asli pehchaan kaunsi hai?\"\n\nMs. Ganguly muskuraayin. \"Roll number 11 teri pehchaan hai. Is class mein koi aur bachcha 11 number nahi ho sakta. Par 40 to poori class ka **total** hai, wo har bachche ka alag nahi hota. Agar kal 2 naye bachche aa jaayein, to total 42 ho jaayega, par tera roll number 11 hi rahega, tu wahi Ishwar rahega.\"\n\nIshwar ne kaha, \"To roll number se **kaun** hai pata chalta hai, aur total se **kitne** hain pata chalta hai?\"\n\n\"Bilkul,\" Ms. Ganguly boli. \"Ab ye soch: atom ke saath bhi aisa hi hai. Har tatva ka ek 'roll number' hota hai jo uski **pehchaan** hai, aur ek alag 'total' hota hai jo nucleus mein kitne kan hain, ye batata hai. Chal, dono ko naam dete hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ms. Ganguly ne subah class mein **roll call** liya. Unke register mein har bachche ka ek roll number tha, aur Ishwar ka roll number 11 tha. Ishwar ne register mein jhaank kar poocha, \"Madam, mera roll number 11 hai, aur class mein 40 bachche hain. Ye 11 aur 40 mein se mera asli pehchaan kaunsi hai?\"\n\nMs. Ganguly muskuraayin. \"Roll number 11 teri pehchaan hai. Is class mein koi aur bachcha 11 number nahi ho sakta. Par 40 to poori class ka **total** hai, wo har bachche ka alag nahi hota. Agar kal 2 naye bachche aa jaayein, to total 42 ho jaayega, par tera roll number 11 hi rahega, tu wahi Ishwar rahega.\"\n\nIshwar ne kaha, \"To roll number se **kaun** hai pata chalta hai, aur total se **kitne** hain pata chalta hai?\"\n\n\"Bilkul,\" Ms. Ganguly boli. \"Ab ye soch: atom ke saath bhi aisa hi hai. Har tatva ka ek 'roll number' hota hai jo uski **pehchaan** hai, aur ek alag 'total' hota hai jo nucleus mein kitne kan hain, ye batata hai. Chal, dono ko naam dete hain.\""
