            "body": "Ek nazar mein poore chapter ka safar: atom ke teen kan, atom ke model, Bohr ki shells, atomic number aur mass number, electronic configuration aur valency, aur aaj isotopes.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Electron, proton aur neutron | Atom ke andar teen kan hain: electron (−1), proton (+1) aur neutron (neutral); inhone Chapter 4 ke \"atom avibhajya hai\" wale vichaar ko badal diya. |\n| Topic 2 | Thomson se Rutherford tak ke model | Thomson ka watermelon model, phir gold-foil experiment se Rutherford ka nucleus wala model: atom zyadatar khali hai, aur bahut chhote, ghane nucleus mein positive charge aur lagbhag poora mass hai. |\n| Topic 3 | Bohr ka model | Electron nishchit shells (K, L, M, N) mein ghoomte hain; shell ki kshamta 2n² hai aur bahari shell mein zyada se zyada 8 electrons. |\n| Topic 4 | Atomic number aur mass number | Z = protons (tatva ki pehchaan), A = protons + neutrons, neutrons = A − Z; ions mein sirf electrons badalte hain. |\n| Topic 5 | Electronic configuration aur valency | First 20 elements ki shell-wali seating; outer electrons se valency, aur duplet ya octet poora hone par inert gases ka stable hona. |\n| Topic 6 | Isotopes, isobars aur upyog | Isotopes mein Z same, A alag (chlorine ka 35.5 ek average); isobars mein A same, Z alag; kuch radioactive isotopes ke upyog hain. |\n\nNivaan ne apni copy band ki. \"Chachu, pehle mujhe lagta tha ki atom bas ek chhoti si goli hai. Ab pata hai ki andar nucleus, shells, protons, neutrons, sab kuch hai.\" Mr. Desai ne hanskar kaha, \"Aur sabse badhiya baat: ab tum naav ki umar ke piche ka raaz bhi jaante ho.\"\n\n---\n\nShabaash! Tumne chapter ke saare 6 topics poore kar liye: ab tum atom ke andar ki poori tasveer samajh sakte ho.\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab hum jaante hain ki atom ke bahari electrons kaise hain. Agle chapter **\"Chemical Bonding\"** mein dekhenge ki inhi electrons ke saath atoms aapas mein asal mein kaise judte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek nazar mein poore chapter ka safar: atom ke teen kan, atom ke model, Bohr ki shells, atomic number aur mass number, electronic configuration aur valency, aur aaj isotopes.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Electron, proton aur neutron | Atom ke andar teen kan hain: electron (−1), proton (+1) aur neutron (neutral); inhone Chapter 4 ke \"atom avibhajya hai\" wale vichaar ko badal diya. |\n| Topic 2 | Thomson se Rutherford tak ke model | Thomson ka watermelon model, phir gold-foil experiment se Rutherford ka nucleus wala model: atom zyadatar khali hai, aur bahut chhote, ghane nucleus mein positive charge aur lagbhag poora mass hai. |\n| Topic 3 | Bohr ka model | Electron nishchit shells (K, L, M, N) mein ghoomte hain; shell ki kshamta 2n² hai aur bahari shell mein zyada se zyada 8 electrons. |\n| Topic 4 | Atomic number aur mass number | Z = protons (tatva ki pehchaan), A = protons + neutrons, neutrons = A − Z; ions mein sirf electrons badalte hain. |\n| Topic 5 | Electronic configuration aur valency | First 20 elements ki shell-wali seating; outer electrons se valency, aur duplet ya octet poora hone par inert gases ka stable hona. |\n| Topic 6 | Isotopes, isobars aur upyog | Isotopes mein Z same, A alag (chlorine ka 35.5 ek average); isobars mein A same, Z alag; kuch radioactive isotopes ke upyog hain. |\n\nNivaan ne apni copy band ki. \"Chachu, pehle mujhe lagta tha ki atom bas ek chhoti si goli hai. Ab pata hai ki andar nucleus, shells, protons, neutrons, sab kuch hai.\" Mr. Desai ne hanskar kaha, \"Aur sabse badhiya baat: ab tum naav ki umar ke piche ka raaz bhi jaante ho.\"\n\n---\n\nShabaash! Tumne chapter ke saare 6 topics poore kar liye: ab tum atom ke andar ki poori tasveer samajh sakte ho.\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab hum jaante hain ki atom ke bahari electrons kaise hain. Agle chapter **\"Chemical Bonding\"** mein dekhenge ki inhi electrons ke saath atoms aapas mein asal mein kaise judte hain."
