            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Pichhle chapter ke Topic 5 mein humne dekha tha ki har atom ki baahari shell mein kuch electrons hote hain, aur **poori bhari baahari shell** (duplet ya octet) stable hoti hai. Wahan hum ek jagah ruk gaye the: Na ne 1 electron diya, Cl ne 1 electron liya, aur kahani adhoori chhod di gayi. Ab sawaal ye hai ki **atoms aapas mein judte kyun hain?** Paani ki ek boond, namak ka ek dana, hawa mein oxygen, ye sab judey hue atoms hi to hain. Aaj hum sirf **\"kyun\"** ka jawab dhoondenge, aur kuch electron-dot ka kaam seekhenge jo aane wale saare topics mein kaam aayega. **\"Kaise\"** ki poori kahani agle topics mein aayegi.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle chapter ke Topic 5 mein humne dekha tha ki har atom ki baahari shell mein kuch electrons hote hain, aur **poori bhari baahari shell** (duplet ya octet) stable hoti hai. Wahan hum ek jagah ruk gaye the: Na ne 1 electron diya, Cl ne 1 electron liya, aur kahani adhoori chhod di gayi. Ab sawaal ye hai ki **atoms aapas mein judte kyun hain?** Paani ki ek boond, namak ka ek dana, hawa mein oxygen, ye sab judey hue atoms hi to hain. Aaj hum sirf **\"kyun\"** ka jawab dhoondenge, aur kuch electron-dot ka kaam seekhenge jo aane wale saare topics mein kaam aayega. **\"Kaise\"** ki poori kahani agle topics mein aayegi."
