            "headingHinglish": "Crayon box ka hisaab",
            "body": "Mr. Sood apne bhatije Mihir ko art class mein le gaye. Mihir ke paas ek crayon box tha jisme **bilkul 8 crayons** ki jagah thi, na kam na zyada. Dukaan ne box mein 8 ka hi khaana bana rakha tha. Mihir ke paas 9 crayons the, to ek crayon box ke upar rakha tha aur bar-bar gir jaata tha.\n\nUsi table par Mihir ka ek dost baitha tha. Uske box mein sirf **7** crayons the aur ek khaana khaali pada tha. Wo baar-baar khaali khaane ko dekh raha tha.\n\nMr. Sood ne hanste hue kaha, \"Mihir, apna extra crayon isko de de.\" Mihir ne ek crayon dost ko de diya. Ab dono ke box **poore 8** se bhar gaye. Na kuch gira, na kuch khaali raha.\n\n\"Dekha?\" Mr. Sood ne kaha, \"Ek ke paas ek zyada tha, doosre ko ek chahiye tha. Dono ki zaroorat ek hi thi, bas ulti disha mein. Atoms bhi yahi karte hain. Sodium ke paas 1 extra electron hota hai, chlorine ko 1 chahiye. Wo dene-lene se dono ki shell poori ho jaati hai.\" Mihir ne poochha, \"Par phir dono ek doosre ke saath kyun rehte hain? Crayon dene ke baad to hum alag ho sakte the.\" Mr. Sood muskuraye, \"Atoms ke case mein dene-lene ke baad ek aur cheez hoti hai: **charge**. Wo hi unhe pakde rakhta hai. Chalo, dhyan se dekhte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Sood apne bhatije Mihir ko art class mein le gaye. Mihir ke paas ek crayon box tha jisme **bilkul 8 crayons** ki jagah thi, na kam na zyada. Dukaan ne box mein 8 ka hi khaana bana rakha tha. Mihir ke paas 9 crayons the, to ek crayon box ke upar rakha tha aur bar-bar gir jaata tha.\n\nUsi table par Mihir ka ek dost baitha tha. Uske box mein sirf **7** crayons the aur ek khaana khaali pada tha. Wo baar-baar khaali khaane ko dekh raha tha.\n\nMr. Sood ne hanste hue kaha, \"Mihir, apna extra crayon isko de de.\" Mihir ne ek crayon dost ko de diya. Ab dono ke box **poore 8** se bhar gaye. Na kuch gira, na kuch khaali raha.\n\n\"Dekha?\" Mr. Sood ne kaha, \"Ek ke paas ek zyada tha, doosre ko ek chahiye tha. Dono ki zaroorat ek hi thi, bas ulti disha mein. Atoms bhi yahi karte hain. Sodium ke paas 1 extra electron hota hai, chlorine ko 1 chahiye. Wo dene-lene se dono ki shell poori ho jaati hai.\" Mihir ne poochha, \"Par phir dono ek doosre ke saath kyun rehte hain? Crayon dene ke baad to hum alag ho sakte the.\" Mr. Sood muskuraye, \"Atoms ke case mein dene-lene ke baad ek aur cheez hoti hai: **charge**. Wo hi unhe pakde rakhta hai. Chalo, dhyan se dekhte hain.\""
