            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Bond ka type** | Ye ki atoms electron dekar-lekar (ionic) judte hain ya baant kar (covalent) | NaCl ionic, H₂O covalent |\n| **Metal + non-metal** | Ionic bond ka nishaan | K + Cl → KCl |\n| **Non-metal + non-metal** | Covalent bond ka nishaan | H + F → HF |\n| **Same tatva ke do atoms** | Hamesha covalent (dono ko electron chahiye, baantna hi padega) | Cl₂, O₂, N₂ |\n| **Formula unit** | Ionic compound ka sabse chhota repeating group | NaCl, CaCl₂ |\n| **Molecule** | Covalent compound ki alag, chhoti ikai | H₂S, CCl₄ |"
