            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Combustion (jalna)** | Koi fuel oxygen mein jal kar garmi aur roshni deta hai | LPG ka chulha, lakdi |\n| **Fuel (eendhan)** | Wo cheez jo jalti hai | Gas, lakdi, koyla, petrol |\n| **Fire triangle** | Aag ke liye teen cheezein: fuel, oxygen, garmi | Teen mein se ek hataya, aag bujhi |\n| **Poora jalna** | Oxygen kaafi ho to fuel ka carbon poora jal kar CO₂ banata hai | Neeli lau |\n| **Adhura jalna** | Oxygen kam ho to carbon poora nahi jalta aur carbon monoxide (CO), ek zehreeli gas, banti hai | Band kamre mein angithi |\n| **Zang (rusting)** | Loha hawa aur nami se bhoora, bhurbhura ho jaata hai | Purani cycle ki chain |\n| **Corrosion** | Metal ka hawa, nami ya gas se dheere-dheere kharab hona | Taambe par hara coat |\n| **Rancidity** | Tel ya ghee ke oxidise hone se gandh aur swaad kharab hona | Purani namkeen |\n| **Antioxidant** | Wo cheez jo oxidation ko roke | Khane mein milaaye jaane wale rakshak |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Combustion (jalna)** | Koi fuel oxygen mein jal kar garmi aur roshni deta hai | LPG ka chulha, lakdi |\n| **Fuel (eendhan)** | Wo cheez jo jalti hai | Gas, lakdi, koyla, petrol |\n| **Fire triangle** | Aag ke liye teen cheezein: fuel, oxygen, garmi | Teen mein se ek hataya, aag bujhi |\n| **Poora jalna** | Oxygen kaafi ho to fuel ka carbon poora jal kar CO₂ banata hai | Neeli lau |\n| **Adhura jalna** | Oxygen kam ho to carbon poora nahi jalta aur carbon monoxide (CO), ek zehreeli gas, banti hai | Band kamre mein angithi |\n| **Zang (rusting)** | Loha hawa aur nami se bhoora, bhurbhura ho jaata hai | Purani cycle ki chain |\n| **Corrosion** | Metal ka hawa, nami ya gas se dheere-dheere kharab hona | Taambe par hara coat |\n| **Rancidity** | Tel ya ghee ke oxidise hone se gandh aur swaad kharab hona | Purani namkeen |\n| **Antioxidant** | Wo cheez jo oxidation ko roke | Khane mein milaaye jaane wale rakshak |"
