          {
            "heading": "Chapter Ka Saar: Chemical Changes and Reactions",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter Ka Saar: Chemical Changes and Reactions",
            "body": "Ek nazar mein poore chapter ka safar: reaction kya hai, uske prakaar, energy aur raftaar, oxidation-reduction, aur aaj roz ki zindagi mein inka asar.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Chemical reaction kya hai | Reaction mein purane bond tootte hain aur naye bante hain, atoms sirf naye tareeke se jud jaate hain (na bante, na khatam hote), isliye mass wahi rehta hai; reactants aur products equation mein dikhte hain. |\n| Topic 2 | Combination aur decomposition | Combination mein do ya zyada padarth milkar ek banate hain (2H₂ + O₂ → 2H₂O); decomposition mein ek padarth tootkar kai banta hai, garmi, bijli ya roshni se (CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂). |\n| Topic 3 | Displacement aur double displacement | Zyada reactive metal kam reactive ko uske salt ke ghol se nikalta hai (Fe + CuSO₄ → FeSO₄ + Cu), reactivity series se pehle hi andaaza; double displacement mein ions saathi badalte hain, aur precipitate ya paani banta hai. |\n| Topic 4 | Energy aur raftaar | Exothermic reaction garmi deta hai, endothermic leta hai; raftaar badhti hai garmi, concentration, chhote tukde aur catalyst se (catalyst khud khatam nahi hota). |\n| Topic 5 | Oxidation aur reduction | Oxidation matlab oxygen judna ya hydrogen nikalna, reduction ulta; dono saath hote hain (redox), aur oxidising aur reducing agent ye kaam karwate hain. |\n| Topic 6 | Roz ki chemistry | Jalna (fire triangle, CO ka khatra), zang aur uski roktham, dusre metals ka corrosion, rancidity aur respiration, sab oxidation ke hi roop hain. |\n\nAshwin ne chips ka packet khola aur ek chips khaya. \"Mama, ab main samajh gaya. Nitrogen ka phoola packet koi thagi nahi, chemistry ka kamaal hai. Aur ye namkeen? Ye ab bahar jayegi, aur agli baar dabba airtight.\" Mr. Kelkar muskuraye. \"Shabaash! Ab tumhe har jagah reaction dikhegi.\"\n\n---\n\nShabaash! Tumne chapter ke saare 6 topics poore kar liye: ab tum reaction ko pehchan sakte ho, uska type aur energy bata sakte ho, aur roz ki zindagi mein jalna, zang aur rancidity ko samajh sakte ho.\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab tak humne dekha ki atoms kaise reaction karte hain. Agle chapter **\"Periodic Table\"** mein dekhenge ki itne saare tatva, jinke vyavhaar itne alag hain, kya ek vyavasthit chart mein sajaaye ja sakte hain?",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek nazar mein poore chapter ka safar: reaction kya hai, uske prakaar, energy aur raftaar, oxidation-reduction, aur aaj roz ki zindagi mein inka asar.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Chemical reaction kya hai | Reaction mein purane bond tootte hain aur naye bante hain, atoms sirf naye tareeke se jud jaate hain (na bante, na khatam hote), isliye mass wahi rehta hai; reactants aur products equation mein dikhte hain. |\n| Topic 2 | Combination aur decomposition | Combination mein do ya zyada padarth milkar ek banate hain (2H₂ + O₂ → 2H₂O); decomposition mein ek padarth tootkar kai banta hai, garmi, bijli ya roshni se (CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂). |\n| Topic 3 | Displacement aur double displacement | Zyada reactive metal kam reactive ko uske salt ke ghol se nikalta hai (Fe + CuSO₄ → FeSO₄ + Cu), reactivity series se pehle hi andaaza; double displacement mein ions saathi badalte hain, aur precipitate ya paani banta hai. |\n| Topic 4 | Energy aur raftaar | Exothermic reaction garmi deta hai, endothermic leta hai; raftaar badhti hai garmi, concentration, chhote tukde aur catalyst se (catalyst khud khatam nahi hota). |\n| Topic 5 | Oxidation aur reduction | Oxidation matlab oxygen judna ya hydrogen nikalna, reduction ulta; dono saath hote hain (redox), aur oxidising aur reducing agent ye kaam karwate hain. |\n| Topic 6 | Roz ki chemistry | Jalna (fire triangle, CO ka khatra), zang aur uski roktham, dusre metals ka corrosion, rancidity aur respiration, sab oxidation ke hi roop hain. |\n\nAshwin ne chips ka packet khola aur ek chips khaya. \"Mama, ab main samajh gaya. Nitrogen ka phoola packet koi thagi nahi, chemistry ka kamaal hai. Aur ye namkeen? Ye ab bahar jayegi, aur agli baar dabba airtight.\" Mr. Kelkar muskuraye. \"Shabaash! Ab tumhe har jagah reaction dikhegi.\"\n\n---\n\nShabaash! Tumne chapter ke saare 6 topics poore kar liye: ab tum reaction ko pehchan sakte ho, uska type aur energy bata sakte ho, aur roz ki zindagi mein jalna, zang aur rancidity ko samajh sakte ho.\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab tak humne dekha ki atoms kaise reaction karte hain. Agle chapter **\"Periodic Table\"** mein dekhenge ki itne saare tatva, jinke vyavhaar itne alag hain, kya ek vyavasthit chart mein sajaaye ja sakte hain?"
          }
