            "body": "Pichhle topic mein Mendeleev ne tatvon ko **atomic mass** ke order mein sajaya, aur khaali jagah chhodkar naye tatvon ki bhavishyavani bhi ki. Par uski table ke andar kuch cheezein adhoori reh gayi: Ar aur K jaise jode ko ulta rakhna pada, hydrogen ka koi pakka ghar nahi tha, aur **pattern ka kaaran** koi nahi jaanta tha. Ab humare paas Chapter 5 ka khazana hai: **atomic number** aur **electron shells**. Isi se aaj table ko ek solid, saaf aur pakka roop milega, jo aaj bhi har lab aur har kitaab mein lagi hoti hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein Mendeleev ne tatvon ko **atomic mass** ke order mein sajaya, aur khaali jagah chhodkar naye tatvon ki bhavishyavani bhi ki. Par uski table ke andar kuch cheezein adhoori reh gayi: Ar aur K jaise jode ko ulta rakhna pada, hydrogen ka koi pakka ghar nahi tha, aur **pattern ka kaaran** koi nahi jaanta tha. Ab humare paas Chapter 5 ka khazana hai: **atomic number** aur **electron shells**. Isi se aaj table ko ek solid, saaf aur pakka roop milega, jo aaj bhi har lab aur har kitaab mein lagi hoti hai."
