            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Moseley** | Ek vaigyanik jisne 1913 mein dikhaya ki tatva ki asli pehchaan atomic number hai | Moseley ka kaam |\n| **Modern periodic law** | Tatvon ke gun unke atomic number par nirbhar karte hain aur dohrate hain | Z ke order mein pattern |\n| **Period (aavart)** | Table ki ek **horizontal row** | Period 3: Na se Ar |\n| **Group (varg)** | Table ka ek **vertical column** | Group 1: Li, Na, K |\n| **Period number** | Tatva ke atom mein shells ki ginti | Mg (2, 8, 2) ka period 3 |\n| **Group number (1, 2)** | Groups 1 aur 2 mein: valence electrons ki ginti | Na ka group 1 |\n| **Group number (13 se 18)** | Valence electrons + 10 | Cl: 7 + 10 = 17 |\n| **Periodic table outline** | Poori table ka dhancha: 18 columns aur 7 rows | Figure 3.1 |",
