            "heading": "Family reunion ka lunch",
            "headingHinglish": "Family reunion ka lunch",
            "body": "Mr. Sawant ke gaon wale ghar mein bada family reunion lunch tha, aur unka bhanja Rudransh bhi aaya tha. Saare cousins jama hue. Rudransh ko pehle kisi ka naam nahi pata tha, par usne dekha ki ek kone mein jo teen cousins baithe hain, teeno ki **hansi ek jaisi** thi: pehle chupchap, phir achanak zor ki khilkhilahat. \"Mama, ye teeno ek hi ghar ke hain na?\" Mr. Sawant bole, \"Haan. Ek hi parivaar ke log aksar ek jaise tareeke se hanste, bolte, khaate hain. Dekho, doosre kone mein jo teen hain, wo sab khaane se pehle haath dhote hain, aur teesre kone ke teeno shaant, kabhi kisi se jhagda nahi.\"\n\nRudransh ne sochkar kaha, \"Yani parivaar ko dekh kar uska swabhav pata chal jaata hai!\" \"Bilkul,\" Mr. Sawant bole. \"Periodic table mein bhi yehi hai. Ek column ke tatva ek **parivaar** hain, kyunki unke baahari shell mein **electrons ki sankhya ek jaisi** hai. Ek ko jaan liya to poori family ka andaaza ho jaata hai. Chalo milte hain table ke char mashhoor parivaaron se.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Sawant ke gaon wale ghar mein bada family reunion lunch tha, aur unka bhanja Rudransh bhi aaya tha. Saare cousins jama hue. Rudransh ko pehle kisi ka naam nahi pata tha, par usne dekha ki ek kone mein jo teen cousins baithe hain, teeno ki **hansi ek jaisi** thi: pehle chupchap, phir achanak zor ki khilkhilahat. \"Mama, ye teeno ek hi ghar ke hain na?\" Mr. Sawant bole, \"Haan. Ek hi parivaar ke log aksar ek jaise tareeke se hanste, bolte, khaate hain. Dekho, doosre kone mein jo teen hain, wo sab khaane se pehle haath dhote hain, aur teesre kone ke teeno shaant, kabhi kisi se jhagda nahi.\"\n\nRudransh ne sochkar kaha, \"Yani parivaar ko dekh kar uska swabhav pata chal jaata hai!\" \"Bilkul,\" Mr. Sawant bole. \"Periodic table mein bhi yehi hai. Ek column ke tatva ek **parivaar** hain, kyunki unke baahari shell mein **electrons ki sankhya ek jaisi** hai. Ek ko jaan liya to poori family ka andaaza ho jaata hai. Chalo milte hain table ke char mashhoor parivaaron se.\""
