            "body": "Kathor paani **zeheela nahi** hai, par kai jagah pareshaan karta hai:\n\n1. **Sabun ki barbaadi:** pehle Ca²⁺ aur Mg²⁺ ko khatam karne mein sabun jaata hai (Part B). Kapde par scum ke dhabbe bhi.\n2. **Ghar ke bartan mein scale:** kettle, geyser, cooker par safed parat jamti hai. **Scale garmi ka kharab conductor** hota hai, isliye heater ko **zyada der** garam karna padta hai: **bijli ya fuel zyada kharch** hoti hai, aur kettle ya geyser jaldi kharab hota hai.\n3. **Industry mein:** boiler mein scale jamne se pipe tang ho jaate hain, garmi theek se paani tak nahi pahunchti, aur boiler bahut garam hokar **kharab ya khatarnak** ho sakta hai. Isliye factories boiler ke liye paani pehle **mridu** karti hain.\n4. **Kapda aur rangai ke kaam:** kathor paani mein kapde ka rang theek se nahi chadta, aur kapde kathor ho sakte hain.\n5. **Pipe jaam:** nal ki pipe mein scale jamne se paani ka bahav kam ho jaata hai.\n\n### Example 5. Geyser mein scale: ek hisaab\n\nMaan lo ek ghar ke paani mein **0.405 g Ca(HCO₃)₂ har litre** hai aur geyser roz **10 litre** paani garam karta hai. Roz ka Ca(HCO₃)₂: 0.405 × 10 = **4.05 g**. Isse CaCO₃: 4.05 × 100 ÷ 162 = **2.5 g** roz. 20 din mein: 2.5 × 20 = **50 g** scale (kuch paani ke saath bahar bhi nikal jaata hai, par ye andaaza batata hai ki geyser ke andar scale jaldi kyun jamta hai).\n\nJaanch: 4.05 ÷ 162 = 0.025, aur 0.025 × 100 = 2.5 ✅.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Kathor paani **zeheela nahi** hai, par kai jagah pareshaan karta hai:\n\n1. **Sabun ki barbaadi:** pehle Ca²⁺ aur Mg²⁺ ko khatam karne mein sabun jaata hai (Part B). Kapde par scum ke dhabbe bhi.\n2. **Ghar ke bartan mein scale:** kettle, geyser, cooker par safed parat jamti hai. **Scale garmi ka kharab conductor** hota hai, isliye heater ko **zyada der** garam karna padta hai: **bijli ya fuel zyada kharch** hoti hai, aur kettle ya geyser jaldi kharab hota hai.\n3. **Industry mein:** boiler mein scale jamne se pipe tang ho jaate hain, garmi theek se paani tak nahi pahunchti, aur boiler bahut garam hokar **kharab ya khatarnak** ho sakta hai. Isliye factories boiler ke liye paani pehle **mridu** karti hain.\n4. **Kapda aur rangai ke kaam:** kathor paani mein kapde ka rang theek se nahi chadta, aur kapde kathor ho sakte hain.\n5. **Pipe jaam:** nal ki pipe mein scale jamne se paani ka bahav kam ho jaata hai.\n\n### Example 5. Geyser mein scale: ek hisaab\n\nMaan lo ek ghar ke paani mein **0.405 g Ca(HCO₃)₂ har litre** hai aur geyser roz **10 litre** paani garam karta hai. Roz ka Ca(HCO₃)₂: 0.405 × 10 = **4.05 g**. Isse CaCO₃: 4.05 × 100 ÷ 162 = **2.5 g** roz. 20 din mein: 2.5 × 20 = **50 g** scale (kuch paani ke saath bahar bhi nikal jaata hai, par ye andaaza batata hai ki geyser ke andar scale jaldi kyun jamta hai).\n\nJaanch: 4.05 ÷ 162 = 0.025, aur 0.025 × 100 = 2.5 ✅."
