            "headingHinglish": "Joote ke dabbe wala \"Do Not Eat\" packet",
            "body": "Mehul ke liye Diwali par naye joote aaye. Usne dabba kholte hi ek chhota sa safed packet dekha, jis par bade akshron mein likha tha: **\"DO NOT EAT\"**. Andar chhote-chhote kaanch jaise daane khadkhada rahe the.\n\n\"Papa ke dost Mr. Limaye ko dikhata hoon,\" Mehul ne socha, kyunki Mr. Limaye ek school mein chemistry padhate the aur shaam ko chai peene aane wale the.\n\nShaam ko Mr. Limaye ne packet ko bina khole haath mein liya. \"Ye **silica gel** hai. Isse kholna ya muh mein daalna mat; ye khaane ki cheez nahi hai, bas dabbe ke andar rakhne ki cheez hai.\"\n\n\"Par kyun, uncle? Joote ke dabbe mein iska kya kaam?\" Mehul ne poochha.\n\n\"Socho, joote ka dabba mahino tak godown mein, phir jahaaz ya truck mein safar karta hai. Hawa mein thodi bahut nami hamesha hoti hai, monsoon mein to bahut. Agar chamde par nami aur fungus laga, to naya joota kharab. Ye packet dabbe ki **nami kheench leta hai**, aur bina geela dikhe.\"\n\n\"Magic hai?\"\n\n\"Nahi, chemistry hai. Aur isi chemistry ke aas-paas ek poori family hai: crystal jo apne andar paani rakhte hain, crystal jo hawa mein paani chhod dete hain, aur cheezein jo hawa se itna paani kheenchti hain ki khud ghol ban jaati hain. Chalo, ek-ek karke samajhte hain.\" Mehul ne copy khol li.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mehul ke liye Diwali par naye joote aaye. Usne dabba kholte hi ek chhota sa safed packet dekha, jis par bade akshron mein likha tha: **\"DO NOT EAT\"**. Andar chhote-chhote kaanch jaise daane khadkhada rahe the.\n\n\"Papa ke dost Mr. Limaye ko dikhata hoon,\" Mehul ne socha, kyunki Mr. Limaye ek school mein chemistry padhate the aur shaam ko chai peene aane wale the.\n\nShaam ko Mr. Limaye ne packet ko bina khole haath mein liya. \"Ye **silica gel** hai. Isse kholna ya muh mein daalna mat; ye khaane ki cheez nahi hai, bas dabbe ke andar rakhne ki cheez hai.\"\n\n\"Par kyun, uncle? Joote ke dabbe mein iska kya kaam?\" Mehul ne poochha.\n\n\"Socho, joote ka dabba mahino tak godown mein, phir jahaaz ya truck mein safar karta hai. Hawa mein thodi bahut nami hamesha hoti hai, monsoon mein to bahut. Agar chamde par nami aur fungus laga, to naya joota kharab. Ye packet dabbe ki **nami kheench leta hai**, aur bina geela dikhe.\"\n\n\"Magic hai?\"\n\n\"Nahi, chemistry hai. Aur isi chemistry ke aas-paas ek poori family hai: crystal jo apne andar paani rakhte hain, crystal jo hawa mein paani chhod dete hain, aur cheezein jo hawa se itna paani kheenchti hain ki khud ghol ban jaati hain. Chalo, ek-ek karke samajhte hain.\" Mehul ne copy khol li."
