            "heading": "Part F: Ghar par adult ke saath: ek chhoti nami ki jaanch",
            "headingHinglish": "Part F: Ghar par adult ke saath: ek chhoti nami ki jaanch",
            "body": "**Ghar par adult ke saath.** Ek **band** silica gel ka packet (jo kisi naye dabbe mein aaya ho) lo. **Use kholna nahi, chakhna nahi, aur bacchon aur pets se door rakhna.** Adult ke saath ye karo:\n\n1. Packet ko kitchen ke tarazu (digital scale) par rakh kar uska mass note karo (jaise 5.0 g).\n2. Use ek plate mein kisi **khuli, geeli jagah** (jaise baarish ke mausam mein khidki ke paas) ek din ke liye rakho. **Plate ko kisi bhi khaane ki cheez se alag rakhna.**\n3. Agle din dobara mass tolo.\n\nNami wale mausam mein packet ka mass **thoda badh** jaata hai, kyunki daane ne hawa se nami kheench li. Agar mass nahi badha, to hawa bahut sookhi thi, ya tarazu itna sensitive nahi hai. Ye koi chemical-reaction wala test nahi hai; ye sirf dikhata hai ki silica gel ki nami ki taraf kheench hai. **Packet ko dobara dabbe mein na rakhna; kaam ho jaane par adult ke haath se kachre mein daal do, aur haath dho lo.**",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Ghar par adult ke saath.** Ek **band** silica gel ka packet (jo kisi naye dabbe mein aaya ho) lo. **Use kholna nahi, chakhna nahi, aur bacchon aur pets se door rakhna.** Adult ke saath ye karo:\n\n1. Packet ko kitchen ke tarazu (digital scale) par rakh kar uska mass note karo (jaise 5.0 g).\n2. Use ek plate mein kisi **khuli, geeli jagah** (jaise baarish ke mausam mein khidki ke paas) ek din ke liye rakho. **Plate ko kisi bhi khaane ki cheez se alag rakhna.**\n3. Agle din dobara mass tolo.\n\nNami wale mausam mein packet ka mass **thoda badh** jaata hai, kyunki daane ne hawa se nami kheench li. Agar mass nahi badha, to hawa bahut sookhi thi, ya tarazu itna sensitive nahi hai. Ye koi chemical-reaction wala test nahi hai; ye sirf dikhata hai ki silica gel ki nami ki taraf kheench hai. **Packet ko dobara dabbe mein na rakhna; kaam ho jaane par adult ke haath se kachre mein daal do, aur haath dho lo.**"
