            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki paani crystals ke andar bhi chhupa hota hai (water of crystallisation), aur kuch padarth hawa ki nami tak kheench lete hain. Topic 2 aur 3 mein ye bhi dikha tha ki paani mein bahut kuch **ghula** hota hai: namak, calcium, magnesium. Ab sawal ye hai ki jo paani nadi, talaab ya borewell se aata hai, wo hamare nal tak **saaf aur surakshit** kaise ban kar pahunchta hai? Aaj hum ek poore city water treatment plant ka safar karenge, ghar ke tareeke dekhenge, aur ek chhota filter bhi banayenge (adult ke saath).",
