            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Water cycle (jal-chakra)** | Paani ka evaporate hokar badal banna aur barish ban kar wapas aana | Samundar se badal, phir barish |\n| **Raw water (kaccha paani)** | Nadi, talaab, nahar ka bina saaf kiya paani | Plant ke gate par bhoora paani |\n| **Screening** | Bade tukde (lakdi, plastic, patte) jaali se rokna | Intake par moti jaali |\n| **Coagulation (jamaav)** | Chhote tairte kanon ko ek saath chipka kar bade gucche banana | Fitkari (alum) daalna |\n| **Floc** | Coagulation se bane halke, rui jaise gucche | Paani mein tairte safed-bhoore tukde |\n| **Sedimentation** | Bhaari kanon ka tank mein neeche baith jaana | Settling tank |\n| **Sand filtration** | Ret ki parton se paani chhanna | Plant ka filter bed |\n| **Chlorination** | Paani mein bahut kam matra mein chlorine milana taaki germs mar jaayein | Plant ka aakhri step |\n| **Germs (rogaanu)** | Bacteria, virus jaise jeev, aankhon se nahi dikhte, bimari phailate hain | Cholera ka bacteria |\n| **Waterborne disease** | Gande paani se phailne wali bimari | Cholera, typhoid, dysentery, jaundice |\n| **Potable water** | Peene layak, surakshit paani | Nal ka treated paani |"
