            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki paani ko **saaf aur surakshit** banane mein kitni mehnat lagti hai: screening, alum, sand, chlorine, phir pipeline. Ab ek seedha sawaal: jab paani banana itna mehnat ka kaam hai, to hum use **gandha** kyun karte hain aur **barbaad** kyun karte hain? Is topic mein pehle dekhenge ki paani **kaise pradooshit (polluted)** hota hai aur uska asar kya hota hai, phir **kaise bachayein**, aur sabse maze ki baat: bachat ko **ginti** mein badal kar dekhenge. Aakhir mein poore chapter ka saar.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki paani ko **saaf aur surakshit** banane mein kitni mehnat lagti hai: screening, alum, sand, chlorine, phir pipeline. Ab ek seedha sawaal: jab paani banana itna mehnat ka kaam hai, to hum use **gandha** kyun karte hain aur **barbaad** kyun karte hain? Is topic mein pehle dekhenge ki paani **kaise pradooshit (polluted)** hota hai aur uska asar kya hota hai, phir **kaise bachayein**, aur sabse maze ki baat: bachat ko **ginti** mein badal kar dekhenge. Aakhir mein poore chapter ka saar."
